Can you find any of the old 'Dragonlance' books by Margaret Weis and
Tracy Hickman in Japan?  The chief evil deity in the game -- Takhisis
-- is another name for Tiamat, the five-headed Chromatic dragon.

I would play her as sort of a female version of Sauron, or the chief
villain-spirit in the Kagaku ninja tai Gatchaman cartoons.

Tiamat also makes an appearance in the old 1980s Dungeons & Dragons
cartoon, where she got no speaking lines. She was simply the most
dangerous, lethal opponent in the series, the one even the main
villain was afraid of.

Anyway, I'd play her as the Wicked Queen in Snow White, or one of the
Furies from Greek mythology.  She should come across as regal,
imperial, dangerous, deadly.

